strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 胃口時好時壞 (食慾略微減低)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 口渴仍有, 略微減少, 喜冷飲."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 自覺身冷, 手足皆冷."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 近二日非常疲憊, 身颤抖."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 大便每日行, 一日平均二次, 便溏."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 月經估計此月十六日至"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈細小無力, 左脈緩(胃氣在), 較右手脈大, 但同樣無力."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃白濕 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎區反應差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 四逆湯症 (服前方後, 真寒現, 現轉為四逆湯症)."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生附子二錢 (另包) 乾薑二錢 炙甘草三錢 黃蓮一錢半(舌有淡黃, 苦味入心以補心. 常與生附子並用.)           三付 六碗煮成兩碗 早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  HT-48(金匱腎氣丸)     一天40粒 晨起淡鹽湯服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data"